IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ehi, hola{{TAG:0007:0007:}}, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Oggi, ovunque mi giri, ci sei tu.
Non mi starai mica seguendo!?

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}rieccoti qua, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Lo sai che in giorni come oggi,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
il mattino non ha l'oro in bocca?!
La sera del solstizio d'estate è
ancora mattina e anche la notte ha
l'oro in bocca. Ehm, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}So {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}we meet again, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
All this {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} sun must
be making you extra peppy!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Volvemos a vernos,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
El solsticio de verano te ha dado
mucha energía, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Eccoci di nuovo qua, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Con tutto questo sole, non ti senti
super pimpantin{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Demek {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}yine karşılaştık, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Şu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Yaz Gündönümü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} güneşi seni iyice
coşturmuş olmalı!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey again, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I'm seeing you a ton today,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
aren't I?
Trying to get a lot done before
nightfall? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Don't worry. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Night's not
falling today, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Guarda chi c'è, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non la smettiamo più di incontrarci
oggi,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} eh?
Cerchi di aver tutto pronto prima
di sera?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Tranquill{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, tranquill{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oggi niente notte, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Lo sapevo. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ero certo che
ci saremmo rivisti, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sembra che tu abbia messo il turbo.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ti capita ogni solstizio d'estate?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Vay, saat gerçekten {{TAG:0004:0003:}}:{{TAG:0004:0004:}} mi? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bana
kalsa şafak bile olabilir.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Yaz Gündönümü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
saat duygumu fena karıştırıyor.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ma guardati! Che splendore che sei!
Tutt{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} in tiro anche a quest'ora!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
